(Page 9 of 56 - 03 - Agent Tools &  Interoperability  with MCP) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability with MCP) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(9) Tj T*
(Figure 1: Weather agent tool-calling example) Tj T*
(Types of tools) Tj T*
(In an AI system, a tool is defined just like a function in a non-AI program. The tool definition) Tj T*
(declares a contract between the model and the tool. At a minimum, this includes a clear) Tj T*
(name, parameters, and a natural language description that explains its purpose and how it) Tj T*
(should be used. Tools come in several different types; three main types described here are) Tj T*
(Function Tools, Built-in Tools, and Agent Tools.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
