(Page 13 of 56 - 03 - Agent Tools &  Interoperability  with MCP) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability with MCP) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(13) Tj T*
(Snippet 3: AgentTool definition) Tj T*
(Taxonomy of Agent Tools) Tj T*
(One way of categorizing agent tools is by their primary function, or the various types of) Tj T*
(interactions they facilitate. Here's an overview of common types:) Tj T*
(* Information Retrieval: Allow agents to fetch data from various sources, such as web) Tj T*
(searches, databases, or unstructured documents.) Tj T*
(* Action / Execution: Allow agents to perform real-world operations: sending emails,) Tj T*
(posting messages, initiating code execution, or controlling physical devices.) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
(from google.adk.agents import LlmAgent) Tj T*
(from google.adk.tools import AgentTool) Tj T*
(tool_agent = LlmAgent\() Tj T*
(model="gemini-2.5-flash",) Tj T*
(name="capital_agent",) Tj T*
(description="Returns the capital city for any country or state") Tj T*
(instruction="""If the user gives you the name of a country or a state \(e.g.) Tj T*
(Tennessee or New South Wales\), answer with the name of the capital city of that) Tj T*
(country or state. Otherwise, tell the user you are not able to help them.""") Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
(user_agent = LlmAgent\() Tj T*
(model="gemini-2.5-flash",) Tj T*
(name="user_advice_agent",) Tj T*
(description="Answers user questions and gives advice",) Tj T*
(instruction="""Use the tools you have available to answer the) Tj T*
(user's questions""",) Tj T*
(tools=[AgentTool\(agent=capital_agent\)]) Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
