(Agent Tools & Interoperability with MCP) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(14) Tj T*
(* System / API Integration: Allow agents to connect with existing software systems and) Tj T*
(APIs, integrate into enterprise workflows, or interact with third-party services.) Tj T*
(* Human-in-the-Loop: Facilitate collaboration with human users: ask for clarification, seek) Tj T*
(approval for critical actions, or hand off tasks for human judgment.) Tj T*
(Table 1: Tool categories & design considerations) Tj T*
(Best Practices) Tj T*
(As tool use becomes more widespread in AI applications and new categories of tools emerge,) Tj T*
(recognized best practices for tool use are evolving rapidly. Nevertheless, several guidelines) Tj T*
(are emerging that seem broadly applicable.) Tj T*
(Tool Use Case Key Design Tips) Tj T*
(Structured Data) Tj T*
(Retrieval) Tj T*
(Querying databases, spreadsheets, or) Tj T*
(other structured data sources \(e.g., MCP) Tj T*
(Toolbox, NL2SQL\)) Tj T*
(Define clear schemas, optimize for efficient) Tj T*
(querying, handle data types gracefully.) Tj T*
(Unstructured Data) Tj T*
(Retrieval) Tj T*
(Searching documents, web pages, or) Tj T*
(knowledge bases \(e.g., RAG sample\)) Tj T*
(Implement robust search algorithms,) Tj T*
(consider context window limitations, and) Tj T*
(provide clear retrieval instructions.) Tj T*
(Connecting to) Tj T*
(Built-in Templates) Tj T*
(Generating content from) Tj T*
(predefined templates) Tj T*
(Ensure template parameters are well-) Tj T*
(defined, provide clear guidance on) Tj T*
(template selection.) Tj T*
(Google Connectors Interacting with Google Workspace apps) Tj T*
(\(e.g., Gmail, Drive, Calendar\)) Tj T*
(Leverage Google APIs, ensure proper) Tj T*
(authentication and authorization, handle) Tj T*
(API rate limits.) Tj T*
(Third-Party) Tj T*
(Connectors) Tj T*
(Integrating with external services) Tj T*
(and applications) Tj T*
(Document external API specifications,) Tj T*
(manage API keys securely, implement error) Tj T*
(handling for external calls.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
