(Page 22 of 56 - 03 - Agent Tools &  Interoperability  with MCP) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability with MCP) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(22) Tj T*
(Google provides multiple MCP Servers for its products including custom managed MCP) Tj T*
(servers on Google Cloud. The following diagram shows the relationships between each of) Tj T*
(these components and how they communicate.) Tj T*
(Figure 2:  MCP Host, Client and Server in an Agentic Application) Tj T*
(This architectural model is aimed at supporting the development of a competitive and) Tj T*
(innovative AI tooling ecosystem. AI agent developers should be able to focus on their core) Tj T*
(competency--reasoning and user experience--while third-party developers can create) Tj T*
(specialized MCP servers for any conceivable tool or API.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
