(24) Tj T*
(* Streamable HTTP: Recommended remote client-server protocol.21  It supports SSE) Tj T*
(streaming responses, but also allows stateless servers and can be implemented in a plain) Tj T*
(HTTP server without requiring SSE.) Tj T*
(Figure 3: MCP Transport Protocols) Tj T*
(Key Primitives: Tools and others) Tj T*
(On top of the basic communication framework, MCP defines several key concepts or entity) Tj T*
(types to enhance the capabilities of LLM-based applications for interacting with external) Tj T*
(systems. The first three are capabilities offered by the Server to the Client; the remaining) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
